          "name": "Week 1",
          "description": "Pick holds you can hang 10 s with good form but fail by 14-15 s. Warm up first. 3 sets of 4 hangs: 10 s hang, 30 s rest. 2 min rest between sets.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "repeat": 3,
              "name": "Set",
              "do": [
                {
                  "repeat": 4,
                  "name": "Rep",
